{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-acres-estates-meraas-dubailand","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":235,"crm_id":"2832","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"The Acres Estates","slug":"the-acres-estates-meraas-dubailand","display_address":"Dubailand","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Meraas","price":14500000,"display_price":"14.5M","lattitude":25.047993921506915,"longitude":55.296348907082645,"min_bedrooms":5,"max_bedrooms":7,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p><span>Welcome to the last phase of The Acres Estates at Dubailand, a prestigious new development by </span><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-meraas/\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow noreferrer\"><span>Meraas</span></a></a><span>, offering an exclusive living experience with a limited collection of <strong>5, 6, and 7-bedroom homes</strong>. Divided into the Ivory and Amber collections, these mansions blend modern luxury with the natural beauty of the surrounding landscapes. Located with direct access to Sheikh Zayed Bin Hamdan Al Nahyan Street and Emirates Road, residents enjoy proximity to Dubai’s top attractions, including Global Village and the Dubai Polo and Equestrian Club.</span></p><p>Set amidst lush gardens, serene lagoons, and undulating terrain, The Acres Estates at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand/\">Dubailand</a> by Meraas provides an intimate yet expansive atmosphere. Designed with natural materials like stone, wood, and glass, each villa harmonizes with its environment, featuring open-plan layouts and large windows to create a seamless connection to nature. Residents can indulge in a variety of amenities, such as swimmable lagoons, floating decks, jogging tracks, and wellness gardens, offering a perfect blend of relaxation and activity in this serene oasis.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/feat_1692f24931.jpg","hash":"feat_1692f24931","name":"feat.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/banner_9e59ea6efc.jpg","hash":"banner_9e59ea6efc","name":"banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/9_ce9fe23ac9.jpg","hash":"9_ce9fe23ac9","name":"The Acres Estates by Meraas"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/1_314fe205cc.jpg","hash":"1_314fe205cc","name":"1.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/2_75275b52c3.jpg","hash":"2_75275b52c3","name":"2.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/11_d1b4188471.jpg","hash":"11_d1b4188471","name":"11.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/8_2ecdb79673.jpg","hash":"8_2ecdb79673","name":"8.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/12_65d196b2e4.jpg","hash":"12_65d196b2e4","name":"12.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/3_398beaf465.jpg","hash":"3_398beaf465","name":"3.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/4_7854a16523.jpg","hash":"4_7854a16523","name":"4.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/6_5e9ad0d219.jpg","hash":"6_5e9ad0d219","name":"6.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/5_8e43496b6f.jpg","hash":"5_8e43496b6f","name":"5.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/10_b76e8c4862.jpg","hash":"10_b76e8c4862","name":"10.jpg"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/7_f473086d19.jpg","hash":"7_f473086d19","name":"7.jpg"}],"images":[],"characteristics_module":{"id":1359,"cta":{"id":2131,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/sellingpoint_c8920916de.jpg","hash":"sellingpoint_c8920916de","name":"sellingpoint.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Acres Estates Mansion: Crafted for Those With the Most Discerning Tastes","heading":"UNIQUE SELLING POINTS","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>A Nature-Infused Luxury Community: Meraas Luxury Villas in Dubai are surrounded by expansive parks and natural landscapes.</li><li>Prime Location with Seamless Connectivity: The Acres Estates at Dubailand by Meraas enjoys a strategic location along Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, ensuring effortless citywide connectivity.</li><li>Sustainable and Eco-Friendly Living: Acres Estates Mansion prioritizes eco-conscious living with 33% lower water consumption and 100% irrigation through treated wastewater.</li><li>Exclusive Resort-Style Amenities: The Acres Estates at Dubailand by Meraas features stunning swimmable lagoons, floating decks, and Halo Loop Park, promoting a healthy lifestyle.</li><li>Architecturally Iconic Villas &amp; Mansions: Acres Estates Mansion presents two architectural collections: the Ivory Collection for nature-inspired elegance and the Amber Collection for ultra-luxury exclusivity.</li><li>A Thriving Community with Smart Infrastructure The Acres Estates at Dubailand by Meraas ensures a pedestrian-friendly environment, with dedicated walking and cycling paths covering 30% of the community.</li><li>Developed by Meraas: &nbsp;The Acres Estates at Dubailand by Meraas is brought to life by Meraas, the developer behind Port de La Mer, Bluewaters Residences, and City Walk.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1360,"cta":{"id":2132,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interes